      {
       "text": "Hello,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "we have some awesome news - we added a horse! This brings a whole lot of exciting things to do in Zombie Watch! You can now buy a horse from a dealer. It will save you a lot of time to travel all over the place.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In the future updates we plan to add a carriage used to transport goods.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We also fixed some issues from the previous version and added some new items, like hay piles and more special places.",
